# Cloudflare Pages redirects — Netlify-style syntax.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# 301 = permanent (browser-cached, SEO-friendly: search engines update
# the canonical URL to the new location).
#
# Both the no-trailing-slash and trailing-slash variants are listed
# explicitly because the _redirects matcher is path-exact unless you
# use a wildcard, and overly-greedy patterns risk catching e.g.
# /privacy-policy-archive or /terms-of-service-2024.

/privacy   /legal/privacy   301
/privacy/  /legal/privacy   301
/terms     /legal/terms     301
/terms/    /legal/terms     301
